∇ c←ddmm HandBuilt rows;k;m
 ⍝ A course namespace shaped like uwsch's. rows: (days starttime endtime start end
 ⍝ component instructor), dates written DD/MM/YYYY and swapped if ~ddmm.
  c←⎕NS'' ⋄ c.(code name)←'ECE 100' 'Signals & Systems @prof \0'
  m←↑rows
  k←⎕NS¨(≢rows)⍴⊂''
  k.number←⍳≢rows
  k.section←{¯3↑'00',⍕⍵}¨⍳≢rows
  k.room←⊂'E7 5343'
  k.days←m[;1] ⋄ k.starttime←m[;2] ⋄ k.endtime←m[;3]
  k.start←m[;4] ⋄ k.end←m[;5] ⋄ k.component←m[;6] ⋄ k.instructor←m[;7]
  :If ~ddmm
      k.start←'swap-dates'∘Vary¨k.start ⋄ k.end←'swap-dates'∘Vary¨k.end
  :EndIf
  c.classes←k
∇
